# Step 4: Test cases («Тест-кейсы»), BEFORE development
Derive every case from step-1 criteria and from step-2 API and error paths. Cover every criterion. Mark which cases become automated. Send a gap to step 3; do not close it in silence.

- Epic: end-to-end cases only.
- Feature: id (`ТК-1`), precondition, steps, expected, level (unit / integration / e2e / ручная на dev). Step 5 starts only after steps 1-4 are on this page («полное ТЗ», `playbook-workflow.mdc`).
- Subtask: no «Тест-кейсы» section. Automate the feature cases the issue names. Bug or small fix: criteria on the issue, skip this section, then steps 5-7.
